OrcheRoute Desktop for Linux
============================

This is a standalone package containing the native Wails/GTK interface,
OrcheRoute Go control plane and Mihomo transport. It does not require the Linux
Server package. HTTP and HTTPS WebUI listeners are disabled; the internal API
is available on loopback only.

Install only the desktop package:

  sudo apt install ./OrcheRoute-Linux-Desktop-0.5.3-12-amd64.deb

The GUI talks to an unauthenticated API bound only to 127.0.0.1. It never reads
/etc/orcheroute/runtime.env. Internal Mihomo secrets remain accessible only to
the root system services.

Run the GUI without sudo. If it does not open, inspect the desktop environment
and local API with:

  orcheroute-desktop --diagnose
